    "body": "I left Android out, because I didn't want to give an example that might become state if we freeze the number. But yes, it's a relevant example, since it's not like the others. Since the Chromium plan is to freeze the Android version at 10, I used 10 in the example on the assumption that Gecko would match Chromium if we freeze it, too.",
